{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"佐武等价"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"佐武等价"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>佐武 (Satake) 等价</strong>是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Langlands对偶","text":"Langlands 对偶群"}},{"Plain":"的一种 “实现”: 由 $G$ 构造的某个几何对象上的某种层范畴实现了其对偶群 $^LG$ 的表示范畴. 几何佐武等价是"},{"Local":{"url":"几何Langlands对应","text":"几何 Langlands 对应"}},{"Plain":"的基石.</p>\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<h3>几何佐武等价</h3>\n<h4>偏屈层版本</h4>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"仿射Grassmann空间","text":"仿射 Grassmann 空间"}},{"Plain":"\n$\\mathrm{Gr}_G$\n上的 "},{"Local":{"url":"弧群","text":"$L^+G$"}},{"Plain":"-等变"},{"Local":{"url":"偏屈层","text":"偏屈层"}},{"Plain":"的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Abel范畴","text":"Abel 范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Perv}_{L^+G}(\\mathrm{Gr}_G)$ 是等变导出范畴上某个偏屈 "},{"Local":{"url":"t-结构","text":"t-结构"}},{"Plain":"的心, 且继承了导出范畴上的卷积, 构成"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":". 几何佐武等价指出这个幺半范畴等价于 "},{"Local":{"url":"Langlands对偶","text":"Langlands 对偶"}},{"Plain":"群 $G^\\vee$ 的表示范畴,\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Perv}_{L^+G}(\\mathrm{Gr}_G) \\simeq \\mathsf{Rep}(G^\\vee).\r\n$$</p>\n<h4>D-模版本</h4>\n"}]}}